    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36649" root="كث" body-key="k">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَّ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِ3َ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَاثَةٌ</span>, <i>It</i> (a thing)
<i>became thick,</i> or <i>dense.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَّ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِ3َ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُثُوثَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَاثَةٌ</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَّ</span>, originally
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِثَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَ3َ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَثٌ</span>; <i>It</i> (hair) <i>became
thick,</i> or <i>dense, without being long.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَّتِ اللِّحْيَةُ</span>, (aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِ3َ</span></b> , TA, or 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثُ3َ</span></b> , A,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَاثَةٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُثُوثَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَثٌ</span>, (and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثٌّ</span>, TA,) <i>The
beard became thick,</i> or <i>dense; and short and
crisp;</i> (K;) <i>not spreading.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثَّ بِسَلْحِهِ</span>
